log	"     |"
log	" 12 |     let n = (&x) as Int"
log	"     |              ^"
log	"   hint: a reference cannot be stored or bound: pass it straight to a `&` parameter, or — to hand out storage a value already owns — declare a `borrows` accessor (`... borrows -> &var T` with `lend`, design 141), which lends the place for a window rather than letting a pointer out"
